--- Research Questions ---

1. Combining Balanced-2 + Nearly Equal Gains (D vs A): LG 0.5544 vs 0.6106 (does not improve)

2. Stability (D vs A): std 0.0664 vs 0.0929, CV 0.1197 vs 0.1522

